            "review_title": "Review at Shifu Dimsum 175 de Tham",
            "review_text": "huong h\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nQuality dim sum\nJun 2014 • Solo\nIt locates in the right centre of “western street”-De Tham, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City, SHI-FU Dimsum House offers more than 30 kinds of dumplings, otherwise including noodles, chicken rice. \nI went pass the restaurant yesterday and ordered 3 dishes: Shrimp dumpling, Roasted duck noodle and Salted Egg Custard Buns. Their tastes were so good. The rates around from $1-$3/dish, very reasonable and it is worth to bring family to come and enjoy at weekend.\nLove this place and will visit again soon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 1, 2014",
